cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: CovertLens
abstract: >-
  Inline steganalysis gate designed for multi-agent evaluation
  harnesses. Inter-agent images are intercepted at the artifact
  store, scored on their original bytes across four channel
  families (spatial LSB, JPEG DCT, metadata, and geometric), and
  decided by a verdict ladder before any recipient access. Scores
  are versioned evidence with coverage and limitations, never
  accusations.
authors:
  - family-names: Darville
    given-names: Jamie
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
license: MIT
